{
  "id": "fox-multishine",
  "name": "Multishine",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": [
    "fox"
  ],
  "goal": "Jump out of each shine and shine again as you leave the ground.",
  "why": "Each shine hits on its first frame, and each jump out of a shine can lead into another shine at ground level. On a shield the chain leaves gaps of {8} frames, too short to react to, and it ends in whatever follows a jump: a grab, a wavedash or an aerial.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 90,
      "height": 8
    },
    "what": "A multishine is a shine, a jump out of it on frame {4}, and the next shine on frame {J+4}, the frame Fox leaves the ground. That shine comes out at ground level and lands {4} frames later, and the next jump goes on the frame after the landing.",
    "expect": "Each chain is judged when it ends, or {60} frames after the first shine: how many shines came out, and the most frames from one shine to the next. After misses, the coach shows your inputs frame by frame against the frame-perfect chain.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 4,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 7
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 7
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 12,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 15
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 15
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 20,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 23
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 23
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 28,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          0,
          -1
        ],
        "frame": 31
      },
      {
        "press": "B",
        "frame": 31
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: down-B. The first shine",
      "4": "Frame {4}: X. The jump cancels the shine",
      "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: down-B as Fox leaves the ground. Shine at ground level",
      "J+8": "Frame {J+8}: landed in the shine",
      "J+9": "Frame {J+9}: X. The next jump",
      "15": "Frame {15}: down-B. The third shine",
      "23": "Frame {23}: the fourth shine",
      "31": "Frame {31}: the fifth shine"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "The second shine",
        "text": [
          "The shine accepts a jump from its fourth frame. Down-B is then ignored until Fox leaves the ground on frame {J+4}: down-B on that frame is an aerial shine. It stops his rise before he has moved up, so it is at ground level, and he lands in it {4} frames later, on frame {J+8}.",
          "Down-B pressed a frame later comes out {2} units up, and Fox floats down in it instead of landing at once."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 4,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
                ],
                "frame": 7
              },
              {
                "press": "B",
                "frame": 7
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: down-B",
              "4": "Frame {4}: X. The jump cancels the shine",
              "5": "Frame {f}: still on the ground. Down-B now is ignored",
              "J+4": "Frame {J+4}: down-B. The second shine, at ground level",
              "J+8": "Frame {J+8}: landed in the shine"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  3
                ],
                "words": "Shine",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  4,
                  4
                ],
                "words": "Jump now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  5,
                  "J+3"
                ],
                "words": "Too soon: down-B is ignored",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+4",
                  "J+4"
                ],
                "words": "Down-B now",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+5",
                  "J+7"
                ],
                "words": "Shine at ground level",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+8",
                  23
                ],
                "words": "Landed in the shine",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "The next jump",
        "text": [
          "Until the shine lands, Fox is in the air, and a jump is his double jump: he rises and the chain ends. The shine lands on its fifth frame, and a jump on the frame after, {5} frames after down-B, starts the next cycle.",
          "From there the cycle repeats: jump {5} frames after each shine, down-B {J} frames after each jump. Frame-perfect, a shine comes out every {8} frames: frames 1, {J+4}, {15}, {23}, {31}."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  0,
                  -1
