      "words": "the slowest shine came {frames} after the one before",
      "headline": "Slow shine",
      "fix": "Jump on the frame after each shine lands, {5} frames after its down-B, and down-B {J} frames after the jump. Frame-perfect, a shine comes {8} frames after the one before.",
      "strict": {
